        "###Discussion\n",
        "\n",
        "The Gaussian Process model successfully captures the nonlinear relationship between building characteristics and energy loads.\n",
        "\n",
        "The high R² values and low prediction errors indicate that GPR is an effective technique for this dataset. Since Heating Load and Cooling Load exhibit a strong correlation (0.976), they share common influencing factors.\n",
