        "The Energy Efficiency dataset is highly suitable for Gaussian Process Regression because of its relatively small size and nonlinear relationships. Although Heating Load and Cooling Load are strongly correlated, separate Gaussian Process models provide better interpretability and prediction capability than combining them into a single parameter."
